WEBVTT

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.360
Hey... wait.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.110
What are you...

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.800
You...

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.180
You stupid jerk!

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.100
What are you doing to me!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:45.770
That's my line! What were <i>you</i> doing-

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:49.110
No...

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.570
I wasn't...

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:54.160
the one who... did that.

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:06.280
So where did that other girl go?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.720
That wasn't me.

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:12.130
Hiyori...

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.640
Hey!

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:17.110
You have a fever. You need to r-

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:25.330
You have a fever. You need to rest.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:34.190
You also have to wear pajamas, even if they make you hot.

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:38.620
...om.

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:43.530
Mom... it hurts.

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:45.830
Mom...

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:56.720
Anyway, Mitsuki, you have to change and go to sleep.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:59.100
And be sure to take some cold medicine.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.410
Thank god!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.220
The heart gauge is back to its normal color!

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:52.120
I didn't know what was going to happen!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.060
Geez!

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:56.510
We almost fell into the Abyss because of you!

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:57.880
But still...

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:01.340
We got oh so cozy!

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.600
I even said that naughty line in the heat of the moment!

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:10.180
But I guess being on top would be too slutty.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:12.570
Oh my god, what was I thinking!

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.290
Hey, Mitsuki?

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.820
Huh, you weren't listening at all.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:22.930
You look totally miserable.
I thought your fever broke.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.160
What's with you? Are you still mad...

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.160
I've had it!
What's with you? Are you still mad...

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:30.010
He thinks I'm a total weirdo!

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:33.620
I can't explain away the T.S.T.!

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:38.070
Any girl who makes a pass while wearing this is just a freak!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.260
I guess this is it.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:54.540
She's going to give up before I reach Heaven's gate.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.950
Rise, my child.

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:10.880
Do you remain here to waste away into nothingness?

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:18.210
Or do you build upon your prayers and make your way to that gate?

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:22.150
The choice is yours.

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:29.820
I... want to...

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.260
There was...

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.200
no other way.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.620
Have you decided what you want?

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:43.620
Of course.

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:51.080
Yuu-kun, what cake does Mitsuki-chan like?

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.310
I think any of them would do.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.460
Come on.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.330
You need to take this seriously!

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:05.880
This is your sister we're talking about!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:07.590
I guess so.

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:11.850
Fine, I'll decide for you.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:14.680
You used to like chocolate, didn't you?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.120
Excuse me!

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:21.380
Yeah, but she was a complete
stranger just a few months ago.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.220
I wouldn't know what she likes.

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:28.570
Hell, I don't even have a clue
what's going through her head.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:30.200
Mom...

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:35.790
Here.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:36.900
Let's go.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:40.710
Say...

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:41.850
Hmm?

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:46.470
Does a person's personality
change with their surroundings?

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:48.750
Why bring that up?

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:50.820
Mi-

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:51.960
Yuki-nee.

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:55.450
You've become a completely different person since you moved away.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:57.920
So I was wondering about it.

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:00.440
Oh, so you prefer the old me?

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:02.510
Yuuya!

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:04.270
She's gonna kill me!

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:06.620
Yeah, no.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:09.650
I'm <i>really</i> fine with the way you are now.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:14.080
There's also this friend.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.980
He used to be cheerful, but now he's quiet all the time.

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:22.290
So it made me think.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:28.320
I'd say it's caused more by his circumstances than by his surroundings.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:31.700
He might have made new friends
or fallen in love with someone.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:35.900
Or maybe he's stressed out about
something bad that happened.

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:41.440
You know, people can change over the tiniest things.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.110
Especially girls.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.760
Is that so?

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:52.570
<i>Your</i> personality hasn't changed
at all since you were little.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:58.260
Would getting a brand-new family be one of those causes?

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:01.530
Wait, I'm <i>the cause?</i>

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:03.550
No.

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:07.590
That wouldn't explain those freaky panties.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:10.910
There must be something more concrete.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:13.300
Oh yeah!

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:16.180
Kyouko-san might be making her wear it!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.200
Are we clear, Mitsuki?

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:21.190
You must remain chaste until marriage!

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:26.010
You are to wear this at all times!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.380
That could explain it.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:35.750
No way.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:39.240
How could that <i>be possible?</i>

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.250
Wanna get crepes?

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:40.980
A friend?

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:41.750
Sure.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.300
There's that one girl I sometimes see with Mitsuki.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.710
Actually, she pops out of nowhere.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.170
Then she'd disappear, just like last night.

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:49.820
She might be Mitsuki's friend.

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:52.480
I think I'll get the banana cream.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:54.390
Maybe I'll get that too.
Did she come for a sick visit?

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:54.920
Maybe I'll get that too.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:58.400
But she didn't put on any lights.

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:04.310
So what was <i>she doing in that dark room?</i>

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:08.300
Oh yeah, she had wings on her back.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.690
Is it that "cosplay" thing people do nowadays?

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:16.870
Mitsuki was running a fever,
yet she was still wearing that thing.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:18.830
Now I get it!

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:23.580
Mitsuki and that girl are a cosplaying lesbian couple!

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.820
That would explain everything!

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:27.580
Those freaky panties are part of her cos-

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:28.820
Hey, Yuu-kun!

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:31.630
Huh? What is it?

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.260
Who do you think...

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:37.010
caused me to change so much?

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:40.060
Who?

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:44.800
Excuse me, are you here for me?!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:48.780
Oh, are you Kanzaki-san? You've got a delivery!

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:51.610
Thanks! I'm coming right over!

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.380
Thanks, Yuki-nee.

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:58.190
For lending me an ear.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:09:59.570
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:09.790
So this is from Dad?

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:12.740
Probably another weird souvenir.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:16.820
Mitsuki?

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:19.640
Welcome home,

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.320
Yuuya-oniichan.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:25.520
I'm back. Are you all better?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.830
Me and Yuki-nee bought this for...

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:35.550
There's something...

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:37.770
I want to tell you.

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:12.780
There's something I want to tell you.

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:18.760
But I want to take a bath before I do that.

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:19.520
Sure...

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:22.310
Huh? A bath?

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:25.900
I didn't take one because I was stuck in bed.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.140
It makes it too embarrassing to talk.

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:29.550
You don't even need one.

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:30.750
Besides, aren't you still...

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.550
I have to take one!

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:35.880
Anyways, you have to take one too!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.340
Why am I doing this?

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:40.910
What on earth is going on?

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:49.020
I don't get it!

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:57.860
God, what does she want to talk about?

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.630
Why make it such a big deal anyway?

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:03.020
And why is she so anxious?

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.680
Is it something important?

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.500
Wait, is she...

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.840
Onii-chan, we need to have The Talk.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:15.450
Is that <i>what she wants?</i>

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:19.060
What do I do?

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:21.510
What the hell do I do?

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:23.930
No, get it together!

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:26.170
I'm supposed to be her older brother.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:30.540
If I act jumpy, it'll just weird
her out from saying anything.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:35.400
Still, though...

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:38.010
What do I do here?

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:54.210
I wonder if three minutes will be enough?

00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:07.560
Mitsuki, are you awake?

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.530
Hey! Mitsuki-chan?!

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:15.080
Good, she's still asleep.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:21.280
This is something important I have to do.

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:24.310
I need to be clean for this.

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:28.310
I don't want to be all sweaty for my first time!

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:33.290
I know I'm crossing all sorts of lines.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.870
And I'm really going to do it with Onii-<i>chan!</i>

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:48.680
If I don't take the initiative, Mitsuki will give up before I reach Heaven's gate.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:53.910
When that happens, we'll both fall head-first into the Abyss!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:59.650
That's right. While Mitsuki's still asleep

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:02.610
I need to take it all the way!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.060
Time to move out!

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:15.190
Yuuya-oniichan.

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:17.560
Sorry I'm late.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.840
Sh-Shouldn't you be wearing pants?

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.670
I-I don't need to!

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:32.530
I'm... still hot.

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:41.810
What? You want me to move?

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:45.650
No! That's not... it.

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:59.180
Oh... Oh god!

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:02.380
I don't know how to broach the subject!

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:06.920
If I tell it to him straight, it'll just freak him out.

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:11.340
So... um...

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:15.220
I should first tell him about Mitsuki and me.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:17.560
No...

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:22.310
He'll never believe that. He'll think I'm crazy.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:30.420
Ahh, god! I'm acting just like Mitsuki!

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:32.990
How'd her indecisiveness rub off on me?!

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.080
In that case...

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.410
I'll just throw him down and have my way with him!

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:45.920
Geez.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.460
Your head's still spinning, isn't it?

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:54.610
You don't take baths when you're still recovering.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:59.010
Oh no! My heart is racing so much I can't think strai-

00:15:59.010 --> 00:16:02.020
Hiyori!

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.250
Oh, you're awake?

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.730
Thanks to that accelerated heartbeat!

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:09.680
You... You waited while I was asleep...

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:14.620
You're awful! Why are you doing this?!

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:16.710
I told you I didn't want this!

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:19.080
But you keep doing it, and I've had it!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.040
Mitsuki!

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:23.000
What?

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:26.210
Why did you trade places with me?!

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:29.170
W-Well...

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:32.930
Things are too different now.

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:34.680
I couldn't stay.

00:16:36.150 --> 00:16:39.520
You think I<i> want to deal with this?</i>

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.560
You started this, why did you quit?!

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.540
I was too nervous!

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:47.440
You all right?

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:53.150
You don't have to... force yourself to come out.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:17:00.370
You wanted to talk about something important, right?

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:07.830
E-Even if you like other girls,
I... won't think you're weird.

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.730
Like other girls?

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:15.420
You know that girl who comes over
a lot and who's into angel cosplay?

00:17:17.920 --> 00:17:21.720
Um, so this means you saw her?

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:26.650
But, if you're going to fool around with her in the house...

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:30.070
could you keep it to a minimum?

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:33.710
I mean, I still have to live here too.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.950
It doesn't look like he sees me now.

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:44.800
But does he really interpret it that way?

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:48.340
A-And about your cosplay thing.

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:51.960
I'm actually all right with it.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.400
Cosplay?

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:57.800
I <i>am</i> kind of concerned about it being too racy.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:02.600
Like that thing you wear under your clothes.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:09.690
No! I think you're free to wear it if you want!

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:14.750
I know it's not my place to even say anything about it.

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:19.990
Wow, he's got it wrong on so many levels.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:23.020
That's <i>what I call a colorful imagination.</i>

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:26.500
I also get how that's your own personal thing.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:30.320
I have absolutely no desire to tell you how to live.

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:35.640
But I do sort of want you to watch yourself.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.550
That's it?

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:44.470
I thought my life was officially over.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.940
But he ended up accepting it in his own way.

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:51.550
I swear, he really is a...

00:18:52.430 --> 00:18:54.400
I mean, look at you now.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.920
You're letting it all hang out.

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:01.280
Tell me sooner!

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:03.960
You stupid jerk! Get out!

00:19:11.050 --> 00:19:12.250
It's freezing.

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:18.700
Lately,

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:22.010
my sister's been acting kind of weird.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:26.450
Hey, is your cold all better?

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:54.390
None for me?

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:57.710
Still.

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:00.170
As long as she's healthy,

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.860
I'm good with that, I guess.

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.790
Please hug me tight.

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:12.390
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:15.270
Come closer to me.

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:18.150
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.470
I want you to notice

00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:34.710
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.010
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:40.170
and go full throttle towards you.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.540
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:45.760
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.020
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:51.100
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:53.730
These ordinary days

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:56.610
are something special to me.

00:20:56.610 --> 00:21:02.110
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:07.830
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:13.250
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:15.960
You’re my man with the charming do

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.740
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:21.450
Well you see, that’s because

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:24.470
I love you very much.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:27.010
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:29.680
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:32.550
I want to keep on loving you

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:35.180
always and forever more.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:23.960
Next time on <i>Recently,
My Sister Is Unusual:</i>

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:26.840
Onii-chan! Onii-chan!
Onii-chan! Onii-chan!

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:29.090
Quit lusting after
my sister.

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:31.550
You'll put on weight if
you don't exercise!

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:34.140
When it comes to school,
there are always clubs!

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:36.580
I have a girlfriend,

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:39.260
but I can't stop thinking
about my own sister!
